"風扇由macOS原廠控制中，情境與上限暫不作用" = "macOS is controlling the fan; profiles and the cap are paused.";
"固定模式不套曲線，只有上限會作用" = "Fixed mode doesn’t use curves; only the cap applies.";
"溫度高或降頻中：暫時不限轉速" = "Hot or throttling: cap lifted for now";
"基本上限（沒有情境符合時）" = "Base cap (when no profile matches)";
"上限越低越安靜，也越可能降頻。本機M4 Mac mini實測（2026-09）：原廠讓風扇停在約2,950 rpm時，P-core慢了7.4%。溫度到hot、critical或降頻時，cool42會暫時忽略上限，降溫後才恢復。" = "A lower cap is quieter and more likely to throttle. Measured on this M4 Mac mini (2026-09): with macOS holding the fan at about 2,950 rpm, the P-cores ran slower by 7.4%. When it’s hot, critical or throttling, cool42 ignores the cap until things cool down.";
"任一個在跑就符合，只看你自己帳號的程式。填程序名稱（例如Visual Studio Code是Code），用逗號分開，不分大小寫；不確定就從右邊選單挑。" = "Matches when any of them is running under your own account. Enter process names (Visual Studio Code is Code), separated by commas, case-insensitive. Not sure? Pick from the menu on the right.";
